        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tap water, at user</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tap water, at user
Rough estimation investigated for CH and data for energy use in DE.;
Formula: H2O; 
UUID: 6556440f-cd03-3975-9615-023309701fe2
Infrastructure and energy use for water treatment and transportation to the end user. No emissions from water treatment.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Example of a water works in CH.
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. 
Extrapolations: From CH and DE to RER situation. Share of resource uses (ground and surface water) estimated.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6556440f-cd03-3975-9615-023309701fe2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
